    "readback": "Given root/ratio meanings and accepted022, uniqueness of each coefficient in basis (1,rho), the checked identities, and D!=0 force every displayed power and factor. Multiplication rows force W=T1*T2*T3*T4*T5. No division by any test, factor, q or W occurs in this algebraic readback.",
